* [**TeX Live / pdfTeX**](https://tug.org/texlive/) — Underlying TeX typesetting engine (`Han The Thanh et al.`).
* [**Xed-Editor**](https://github.com/Xed-Editor/Xed-Editor) — Integrated Android text/code editor module.
* [**Sora Editor**](https://github.com/Rosemoe/sora-editor) — High-performance code editor component powering Xed-Editor.
* [**Flaticon**](https://www.flaticon.com/) — App icons, file type badges (`.tex`, `.pdf`, `.log`), and UI graphics used throughout the interface.